Rodney's SAMU attack should only snatch the Amulet, Candelabrum, Bell,
Book, or your quest artifact (or appropriate fakes, I think).  He's not
going to go stealing your longswords.  

> Even nymphes did it to me while fighting other monsters.

Nymphs usually start sleeping, can be killed in one hit, and have an
extremely low chance of getting a successful attack on a high-level
character.  If you see one coming, smack it with a magic missile or
wand.

> I more than once only survived because of fair Martial Arts.

And if your swords do get stolen, which should only happen because of
mistakes on the player's part, you'd be much better served putting your
skill points into spells and carrying a spare weapon in your bag.
Better to spend a round taking out a Brand or Vorpy than to whack a
monster with your fists.  

